 "nl": [
  "Apart from vpn-users on NTP (UDP 123); library on HTTPS (TCP 443), all traffic originating in hr must be dropped.",
  "library may use TCP ports 1024-65535 towards dev-lab, except RDP (TCP 3389), PostgreSQL (TCP 5432), MySQL (TCP 3306), which must be blocked.",
  "Block PostgreSQL (TCP 5432) from dev-lab to guest-wifi; the rest of TCP ports 1024-65535 between them is allowed.",
  "vpn-users is isolated: it may only reach guest-wifi on DNS over UDP 53, and nothing else.",
  "partners must accept SMB (TCP 445) and SSH (TCP 22) and PostgreSQL (TCP 5432) from printers.",
  "Any zone may connect to library over HTTP (TCP 80).",
  "backup must accept IMAP (TCP 143) and RTSP (TCP 554) and PostgreSQL (TCP 5432) from library.",
  "Block SMB (TCP 445), Telnet (TCP 23), RDP (TCP 3389) from partners to printers; the rest of any TCP port between them is allowed."
